---
// 共用「閱讀頁」本體（參考 Aesop 編輯文版型）。盤點頁與一般編輯文都用它，差別只在 showProducts。
// 內文文字先佔位待 PO；盤點變體把 trend.products 一節穿插一個。
import RelatedReads from './RelatedReads.astro';
import MoreTrends from './MoreTrends.astro';

interface Props {
  trend: any;
  title: string;
  kind: string; // 例：年度盤點 / 編輯觀點
  showProducts?: boolean;
}
const { trend, title, kind, showProducts = false } = Astro.props;

const sections = [
  { id: 'sec-1', title: '這股趨勢怎麼開始的' },
  { id: 'sec-2', title: '它如何改變我們的保養' },
  { id: 'sec-3', title: '值得關注的方向' },
];

const relatedItems = [
  { title: '為什麼今年的保養，開始講求由內而外？', meta: '編輯部 · 2026/06/30', href: `/trends/${trend.id}/read` },
  { title: '編輯實測：這個趨勢值得入手的三個理由', meta: '編輯部 · 2026/06/30', href: `/trends/${trend.id}/read` },
  { title: '達人觀點：保養的下一步，正往哪裡走', meta: '編輯部 · 2026/06/30', href: `/trends/${trend.id}/read` },
];

const socials = ['ti-brand-facebook', 'ti-brand-line', 'ti-brand-threads', 'ti-brand-x', 'ti-link'];
---

<article class="px-6 pt-24 md:pt-28">
  <!-- 麵包屑 -->
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[760px]">
    <nav class="text-xs text-ink-tertiary">
      <a href="/" class="transition-colors hover:text-ink">首頁</a>
      <span class="mx-1">›</span>
      <a href={`/trends/${trend.id}`} class="transition-colors hover:text-ink">{trend.zhName}</a>
      <span class="mx-1">›</span>
      <span>閱讀</span>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <!-- 置中標題 + byline -->
  <header class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-[760px] text-center">
    <p class="text-xs tracking-[2px] text-primary">{kind}</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 font-serif text-3xl leading-snug text-heading md:text-[40px]">{title}</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 text-xs text-ink-tertiary">何雅萍 · 2026/06/30</p>
  </header>

  <!-- 主圖 -->
  <div class="mx-auto mt-10 flex aspect-video max-w-[920px] items-center justify-center bg-bg-product">
    <i class="ti ti-photo text-4xl text-ink-tertiary" aria-hidden="true"></i>
  </div>

  <!-- 上方兩欄：左章節目錄、右導言 -->
  <div class="mx-auto mt-12 max-w-[920px] md:grid md:grid-cols-[180px_1fr] md:gap-12">
    <aside class="mb-8 md:mb-0">
      <ul class="space-y-2.5 border-l border-line pl-4 md:sticky md:top-24">
        {
          sections.map((s) => (
            <li>
              <a href={`#${s.id}`} class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink-secondary transition-colors hover:text-primary">
                {s.title}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </aside>
    <div class="max-w-readable">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-heading">{trend.body}</p>
      {trend.intro?.map((p) => <p class="mt-6 text-base leading-loose text-ink-body">{p}</p>)}
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 內文分節 -->
  <div class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-readable">
    {
      sections.map((s, si) => (
        <section id={s.id} class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2 class="mt-14 font-serif text-2xl leading-snug text-heading">{s.title}</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-loose text-ink-body">小節內文待補，說明此段的觀察與脈絡，承接上文並引出重點。</p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-loose text-ink-body">第二段內文待補，補充細節、例子或數據，讓論述更完整。</p>

          <div class="my-8 flex aspect-video w-full items-center justify-center bg-bg-product">
            <i class="ti ti-photo text-3xl text-ink-tertiary" aria-hidden="true" />
          </div>

          {showProducts && trend.products[si] && (
            <div class="my-7 flex flex-col gap-5 rounded-md border-[0.5px] border-line bg-bg-surface p-5 md:flex-row md:gap-7 md:p-6">
              <div class="flex aspect-[4/3] w-full shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-sm bg-bg-product md:w-[240px]">
                {trend.products[si].img ? (
                  <img src={trend.products[si].img} alt={trend.products[si].name} class="h-full w-full object-contain p-3" loading="lazy" />
                ) : (
                  <i class="ti ti-photo text-2xl text-ink-tertiary" aria-hidden="true" />
                )}
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-xs font-medium tracking-[1px] text-ink-tertiary">品牌待補</p>
                <p class="mt-1 font-serif text-xl text-heading">{trend.products[si].name}</p>
                <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-body">{trend.products[si].desc}</p>
                <a href="#" class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-base text-primary transition-colors hover:text-primary-deep" data-track="cta_buy">
                  心動這裡買
                  <i class="ti ti-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true" />
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          )}
        </section>
      ))
    }

    <!-- 引言 -->
    <blockquote class="my-14 text-center">
      <p class="font-serif text-xl italic leading-relaxed text-heading md:text-2xl">
        每一次選擇，都是在說明你想成為什麼樣的人。
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-ink-tertiary">— 受訪者待補</p>
    </blockquote>

    <!-- 分享 -->
    <div class="border-t border-line py-10 text-center">
      <p class="text-base text-ink-secondary">喜歡這篇趨勢觀察？分享給朋友</p>
      <div class="mt-5 flex justify-center gap-3">
        {
          socials.map((icon) => (
            <a
              href="#"
              class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-[0.5px] border-line text-ink-secondary transition-colors hover:border-ink/30 hover:text-ink"
              data-track="cta_share"
              aria-label="分享"
            >
              <i class={`ti ${icon} text-lg`} aria-hidden="true" />
            </a>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

<RelatedReads items={relatedItems} />
<MoreTrends currentId={trend.id} />
